    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ko̱r kɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Thi-ri-ya ni Bɛn-a-dad rɛmdɛ mat kɛɛliw. Kä te kua̱r ti jiɛn diɔ̱k kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, kɛ jiöŋkööri kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛli. Kä cuɛ Tha-mɛ-ria wä go̱l kä cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ naath jäk kä Ɛ̈-ɣab kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl wi̱c, kä jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Bɛn-a-dad ɛ i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Da̱a̱pdu kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r kɛ nyinkä. Kä mänku tin gɔw kɛnɛ gaatku kɛ nyinkä.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ loc i̱, “Ce̱tnikɛ mɔ ciɛ larɔ lö kuäärä, Ɛ ɣän duŋdu nikɛ nyinkä diaal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ja̱a̱k rɔ nyɔk kɛ ben i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Bɛn-a-dad i̱ ‘ɣän ja̱k kä ji̱ kä naath, kɛ ɣöö bi ɣä ka̱m da̱a̱pdu, kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kɛ mänku, kɛnɛ gaatku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ciɛ jɛn kärɔa, bä ji̱ jäk kä ji̱ kɔaarä i̱ ruun kɛn gua̱th ɛmɛ, ba dhɔru kɛnɛ dho̱r ji̱ kɔaaru wä go̱r, kä ba min nhɔki ka̱n.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl bööth wec diaal cɔl, kä cuɛ wëë, “Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ täämɛ wut ɛ mi go̱o̱rɛ riɛk. Cɛ ɣä jäk kä raan go̱rɛ mänkä kɛnɛ gaatkä, kä go̱o̱rɛ da̱a̱pdä kɛnɛ ciɛk in bo̱r, kä /ka̱n kɛ pen jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth diaal kɛ nɛy diaal ɛ jiök i̱, “/Cu jɛ liŋ kä cu riɛk kɛ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ja̱a̱k Bɛn-a-dad jiök i̱, “La̱rɛ jɛ kuäärä ni kuäär i̱ ‘Tin diaal tin ci thiec kɛ nhiam kä kuanydu bäkɛ la̱t. Duundɛ ɣöö ti̱ti̱ /cä kɛ bi la̱t.’ ” Kä cu ja̱a̱k ruac luɔ̱c Bɛn-a-dad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛn-a-dad jɛ jäk kä raan wëë i̱, “Dëë Kuɔth ɣä näk, mi wëë tekɛ tup mi bi duɔth tetni nɛɛnikä diaal tin guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ loc i̱, “Jiökɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Ci raan rɔɔdɛ a liak a /kenɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r ni la̱t, la jɛ a latdi a cɛ thuɔ̱k.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci Bɛn-a-dad ruac ɛmɔ liŋ guäth in mäthɛ kɛ kɔaŋ kɛnɛ kua̱r rɛy ka̱a̱t, cuɛ nɛɛkɛ jiök i̱, “Kuanyɛ tuɔ̱ŋ.” Kä cukɛ wec kuëny tuɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ cu gök ben thieekä Ɛ̈-ɣab kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhialɛ nɛni nɛy ti ŋuan ti̱ti̱? Ɛn walɛ bäkɛ ka̱m ji̱. Kä biɛ cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈-ɣab wëë, “Kä ɛ ɣän bi jɛ la̱t ɔ?” Kä cu gök ɛ loc i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ bi ŋuɛ̈tni kɔaar bo̱o̱thä wec ɛ la̱t.” Kä cuɛ wëë, “Kä ɛŋa bi ko̱r tok ɔ?” Kä cu gök ɛ loc i̱ “Ɛ ji̱n.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ ji̱ kɔaari bööthni wi̱i̱ni ma̱a̱t kä cukɛ a kur rɛw wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ rɛw. Kä cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ti bathdɔɔri bärɔw car kɔɔriɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wä raar kɛ bua̱k ca̱ŋ, guäth in mäth Bɛn-a-dad kɛ kɔaŋ rɛy bi̱lɛkä, kɛnɛ kua̱r ti jiɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k tin lua̱kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔaari bööthni wec wä raar kɛ nhiam. Kä cu Bɛn-a-dad naath ja̱k, kä cua jɛ ben jiök i̱, “Bä naath raar kä Tha-mɛ-ria.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wëë, “Mi bäkɛ raar kɛ mal ka̱pɛ kɛ a tëk, kä mi bäkɛ raar kɛ ko̱r ka̱pɛ kɛ a tëk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ŋuɛ̈tni kɔaari bööthni wi̱i̱ni wä raar rɛy wec kɛ nɛy tëë guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ramɔ ram in lot ni jɛ näk. Kä cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya rɔ bar kä cu I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r, duundɛ ɣöö cu Bɛn-a-dad kuäär Thi-ri-ya rɔ bar kɛ jiök tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛnɛ ji̱ jiöŋkööri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl jio̱o̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛnɛ thurbiɛɛli käp, kä cuɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya näk ɛlɔ̱ŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
