          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔaar kua̱r Thi-ri-ya kuäär jiök i̱, “Kuthkiɛn kɛ kuth päämni, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bum ni kɛn kä kɔn. Duundɛ ɣöö mi nyiëëny kɔn kɛ kɛ dɛɛkä, kɛ thuɔ̱k dëë buɔ̱m ni kɔn kä kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä lätni nɛmɛ. Woc kua̱r, kä läthni bööth rɛ̈m gua̱thnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuany rɛm mi ce̱tkɛ mëë ci bath, jio̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k kɛ jio̱k tuɔ̱ruɔ̱k, thurbil kɛ thurbil. Inɔ banɛ cu nyieenykɛ kɛ dɛɛkä kɛ thuɔ̱k bi buɔ̱m ni kɔn kä kɛ.” Kä cu kuäär ni Bɛn-a-dad ruacdiɛn liŋ, cuɛ la̱t ni̱nɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ruel cu Bɛn-a-dad ji̱ Thi-ri-ya mat, kä cuɛ wä kä Ä-pek wëë nyiëëny kɛ I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ mat kä cukɛ rɔ̱ rialikä, kä cukɛ wä kä kɛ. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl pua̱t nhiamdiɛn ce̱tkɛ buɔ̱n deet böwni ti tɔt, kä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya ca thiäŋ ni dɔr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu raan Kuɔth ben thiekä kä cuɛ kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhialɛ i̱, ‘Kɛ ɣöö caar ji̱ Thi-ri-ya jɛ Kuoth Nhial ɛ Kuoth päämni /ciɛ Kuoth löli, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ɣän bä ji̱ ka̱m kɛn nɛy ti ŋuan ɛlɔ̱ŋ inɛ ti, kä biɛ cu ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ ɣän Kuoth Nhial.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ pua̱t a lot kɛn ni rɔ̱ kɛ ni̱n bärɔw. Kɛ bärɔw ni̱ni cu ko̱r röm. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ji̱ Thi-ri-ya näk nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kuɔ̱r kɛl kɛ cäŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔthkiɛn rɔ̱ bar kä Ä-pek. Kä cu päny nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bärɔw tëë ci duɔth tethikä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Bɛn-a-dad cuɛ rɔ bar bä, kä cuɛ rɔ wä tɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ duëël rɛci kä duël wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛnɛ täämɛ, ca̱kɔ liŋ ɛn ɣöö kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ kua̱r ti tekɛ pälikä. Yianɛ bieyni cuali lɛtdan kä banɛ wuɔ̱th kɔn kum, kä banɛ wä kä kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl. Dɔ̱ŋ bɛ ji̱ päl a tëk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ lɛtkiɛn yiɛn kɛ bieyni cuali. Kä cukɛ wuɔ̱thkiɛn rith, kä cukɛ ben kä kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kä cukɛ wëë, “Ci kuanydu ni Bɛn-a-dad wëë, ‘La̱ŋä ni ji̱ jak ni ɣä kä tëk.’ ” Kä cu Ɛ̈-ɣab wëë “Ŋotdɛ kɛ tëk? Ɛ dämaar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu ji̱ kɔaar Bɛn-a-dad ɛ käp ala nyuuth mi gɔaa, kä cukɛ jɛ yuɔ̱th thi̱n kɛ pɛ̈th i̱, “Ɣɔ̱ɔ̱n, dämuɔɔr ni Bɛn-a-dad.” Kä cuɛ wëë, “Wiaa nööŋɛ jɛ.” Kä cu Bɛn-a-dad ben kä jɛ. Kä cuɛ Bɛn-a-dad jak kä ko̱tdɛ rɛy thurbiɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛn-a-dad jɛ jiök i̱, “Wi̱i̱ tëë ci gua̱a̱r kɛ ka̱n kä guur bäkɛ luɔ̱c ji̱. Kä deri rɔ cu la̱t duka̱ni kä Da-math-kɛth, ce̱tkɛ mëë ci gua̱a̱r ɛ la̱t kä Tha-mɛ-ria.” Kä cu Ɛ̈-ɣab wëë, “Ɣän bä ji̱ jak kä wä kɛ kui̱ rieetni ti̱ti̱.” Inɔ cuɛ ruac mat kɛ jɛ kä cuɛ jak kä wä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luk go̱kä kɛ Ɛ̈-ɣab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëë kɛ wut kä gaat göökni cuɛ däman jiök kɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial i̱, “Yɔ̱t ɣä la̱ŋä ni ji̱.” Duundɛ ɣöö cu wut yɔ̱a̱tdɛ lo̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Kɛ ɣöö /keni ruac Kuɔth Nhial luɔ̱th, niɛ mɔ bi jiɛɛnɔ ɛn wa̱nɛ, bi lony ji̱ cam.” Kä niɛ min däkɛ piny cuɛ röm kɛ lony kä cuɛ jɛ cam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wut mi dɔ̱ŋ jek, kä cuɛ wëë, “Yɔ̱t ɣä la̱ŋä ni ji̱.” Kä cu wut ɛ yɔ̱t, kä cuɛ jɛ moc buɔ̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gök jiɛn cuɛ kuäär wä lip dup, kä cɛ rɔ jay kɛ ɣöö cɛ waŋdɛ yiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wä kuäär, cuɛ cɔl wëë i̱, “Kuanydu cɛ wä däär köör. Kä nɛnɛ, cu raan rɛ̈m ɣä nöŋ raan kä cuɛ ɣä jiök i̱, ‘Tit wut ɛ mi. Mi wëë wä bath, bi li̱w kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ, kiɛ bi bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k kä ciɛk in bo̱r mi ko̱k ko̱k ŋun.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min lät kuanydu wa̱nɛ mɛ kɛnɛ wi̱ni ɛ mi cɛ wä ɛn raan.” Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ jiök i̱, “Nɔmɔ ɛ ruacdu. Ciɛ lat niɛ ji̱n puɔ̱nydu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ pɛ̈th kɛ käm yieenä raar waaŋdɛ. Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ɛ ŋic ɛn ɣöö ɛ ram kɛl kä go̱o̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ i̱, ‘Kɛ ɣöö ci ram in cä lar i̱ bi li̱w jak kä wä baaŋ, kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bi li̱w kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ, kä bi nɛɛku li̱w kɛ gua̱a̱th nɛɛnikɛ.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl wä dhɔrɛ kɛ kɛ̈c kɛnɛ jiath lɔaac, kä cuɛ ben kä Tha-mɛ-ria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
